in a short version, but what would be some of the things that of what we've talked about

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:31,500
that we really think are the important pieces for someone to...

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,920
I think the idea of you talking about something, an incident happens and it's not so much the

5
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:42,640
incident and so that's why fixing it doesn't really help.

6
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:48,300
The idea of being with you versus standing on the outside and basically saying, come

7
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,300
